   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Time of the Season** (1 review): JJ started with Time of the Season before transitioning into Spooky [3]\n- **Spooky** (1 review): First track is the Classics IV song, not Time of the Season [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Time of the Season**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Spooky**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Any of guys fans of Mr. Show?**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2003-10-03.mc012.instore.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 35 min; rated 2.5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2003-10-03.mc012.instore.flac16**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Oktava MC012 > Edirol UA5 > Sharp MDMS702 [1]",
